@startuml
' Report 4: 3.13.2.2
title FE-48 - Manage and Ingest Knowledge Documents
hide footbox
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam maxMessageSize 170
skinparam ParticipantPadding 16
skinparam sequence {
 ArrowColor #202020
 LifeLineBorderColor #777777
 ParticipantBackgroundColor white
 ParticipantBorderColor #202020
 ActorBackgroundColor white
 ActorBorderColor #202020
 ActivationBackgroundColor white
 GroupBackgroundColor white
 GroupBorderColor #444444
 ReferenceBackgroundColor white
}
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFFFF0
skinparam NoteBorderColor #777777
actor "Authorized User" as U
participant "SSFM Interface" as UI
caption Existing + proposed extension - target design, not a claim of complete implementation
U -> UI : 1. Choose an action
activate UI
UI -->> U : 2. Show the selected form or view
deactivate UI
alt 2.1 Add document
' ref-target: FE-48-INGEST
ref over U,UI : 2.1.1. Create and ingest document\n(FE-48-INGEST)
else 2.2 Browse or remove documents
' ref-target: FE-48-MANAGE
ref over U,UI : 2.2.1. Manage knowledge documents\n(FE-48-MANAGE)
else 2.3 Synchronize Drive
' ref-target: FE-48-DRIVE
ref over U,UI : 2.3.1. Synchronize knowledge folder\n(FE-48-DRIVE)
end
' Source references:

@enduml
